--[[
    GalaxyHub  |  Auto Code Redeemer
    Window size: 280 x 360 (same as the original)

    Features
      - Auto Code capture from the game's notification remote (original logic kept)
      - Auto Submit, Retype Invalid, Submit-after counter
      - Manual redeem box
      - Live stats (Captured / Submitted / Invalid) + session timer
      - Codes history (click a code to resend it)
      - Color-coded log console with Copy / Clear
      - 5 themes, window transparency slider
      - Skip duplicates, auto-copy codes, toasts, Anti-AFK, auto-save config
      - RightShift = hide / show, Unload button
]]

